---
description: Guidelines to prevent mistakes
globs:
  - "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

- when: runningCommand
  then:
    - message: |
        SUPER CRITICAL: Don't use Cursor (Dev Server) terminal. 
        Always run `cd frontend` **before any frontend command** (like `cd frontend; npm run start:dev`).
        CRITICAL: Use the SAME terminal for all commands! Do not switch between "Cursor" and "Cursor (Dev Server)" terminals,
        because `cd frontend` only affects the terminal where it was executed.

- when: editing
  then:
    - message: |
        Follow industry-level coding practices.
        Update `README.md` and `memory-bank.md` whenever relevant changes are made.
        Ask for admin permissions if required before proceeding.
        Whenever possible use docker based approach.
        Dont add tests for everyting it makes the app bulky
